                                                "sense_id": "d9089946-643f-3b0b-88b1-b5ca5f328ae4",
                                                "text": "Expanding the introductory section to include definitions of indirect and direct development and generalized descriptions of spermiogenesis, oocyte maturation and cytological organization, and fertilization would also help de-mystify these subjects for many readers."
